  "description": "Find all critical connections (bridges) in a network of n servers.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1. initialize timer = 0, discovery = [], low = [], result = []\n2. dfs(node, parent):\n3.   discovery[node] = low[node] = ++timer\n4.   for neighbor in adj[node]:\n5.     if neighbor == parent: continue\n6.     if visited[neighbor]: low[node] = min(low[node], discovery[neighbor])\n7.     else:\n8.       dfs(neighbor, node)\n9.       low[node] = min(low[node], low[neighbor])\n10.      if low[neighbor] > discovery[node]: result.push([node, neighbor])",
